      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PK = Primary Key    FK = Foreign Key\n1 : N = One-to-Many relationship\nPost_Tags = Junction table for Many-to-Many (Posts <-> Tags)\nDashed line = Users write Comments",
